      "message": "to fit our purpose, here we need to:\ngetAllAvailableSubscriptions (active ones + inactive eSIM),\nfind the corresponding one (subId \u003d\u003d subscriptionId),\nthen check permission against it:\n  if active, call TM#hasCarrierPrivilege(package) \n  if inactive, call SM#canManageSubscription(package)\nIf permission passed, return it otherwise return null.\nThen it solves the below concern whether comparing carrier ID is enough or not.",
      "range": {
