      "writtenOn": "2019-03-19T01:41:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can\u0027t assume that the carrier privilege rules of the target subscription will be loaded. For instance, if we switch subscriptions on a PSIM between Sprint and T-Mobile, when the Sprint profile loads, it will be grouped with TMO, but the TMO subscription will be invisible at that time.\n\nThis particular function is just something that seems straightforward and I\u0027m not sure why it\u0027s not already there for convenience.",
      "parentUuid": "ba73f15c_e3cb1025",
